{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39042","headline":"吹笙引 · 王毂","name":"吹笙引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娲皇遗音寄玉笙，双成传得何凄清。\n丹穴娇雏七十只，一时飞上秋天鸣。\n水泉迸泻急相续，一束宫商裂寒玉。\n旖旎香风绕指生，千声妙尽神仙曲。\n曲终满席悄无语，巫山冷碧愁云雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王毂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}